I want to create a new skill for baby sitting a PR once I have opened it. I don't want to have it agent specific, any agent harness should be able to use it.&#x20;



essentially the idea is that once I create a PR I can say "babysit this PR for me" and the agent will watch the PR and maintain it so that it is ready to merge.&#x20;



Somethings it will need to montor:&#x20;



- CI checks. Ensure the CI checks we run are always green
- PR feedback comments, wait for agents or humans to leave code comments via a review, and then automatically triage the feedback comments for me to approve.
- When resolving pr feedback comments, run the skill and ensure the responses to comments the agent posts are clearly marked as from a bot and what model and harness is being used. ( we probably need ot update the resolve-pr-feedback-comments skill with that detail too.&#x20;
- Ensure no merge conflicts. Should be using resolve pr merge conflicts skill
- absolutely no merge commits, and rebasing only when needed with force lease



What else? Based on the the sessions I havea had with agents in all harnesses for the last 4 weeks, how do I get a PR across the line. What can we automate with this babaysit skill?

